en punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">)</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token keyword" style="font-style:italic">external</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">;</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
