<p>Reports a validator that was requested to exit, but has not exited yet. The report is used to track potential exit‑delay penalties for the responsible node operator within the specified staking module.</p>
<p>Called by the designated verifier contract (<a class="" href="/contracts/validator-exit-delay-verifier">ValidatorExitDelayVerifier</a>) that verifies validator status on Consensus Layer. Restricted to the <code>REPORT_VALIDATOR_EXITING_STATUS_ROLE</code> role.</p>
