<p>Called by the <a class="" href="/contracts/triggerable-withdrawals-gateway">Triggerable Withdrawals Gateway</a>. Restricted to the <code>REPORT_VALIDATOR_EXIT_TRIGGERED_ROLE</code> role.</p>
